   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c8b180bf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "On this path the book collects about 46 k$ of theta and pays about 55 k$ of gamma: the\n",
    "market moved a bit more than the implied vols priced. Unexplained is around a tenth of gamma. It\n",
    "builds up when an option is at the money near the end of its month, where gamma itself moves a\n",
    "lot within a day and a second-order expansion is no longer enough. Vega is zero because the\n",
    "simulated implied vols never move."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d505ddb4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Implied vs realised volatility, on the crack alone\n",
    "\n",
    "The classic result of delta hedging: a hedged short option earns roughly\n",
    "½ Γ F² (σ²_implied − σ²_realised) per day. To read it cleanly we take the sold crack call\n",
    "(APO-003) alone, priced at the implied vols, and let the market realise 60%, 100% and 140% of\n",
    "them. 40 paths each, costs off."
   ]
  },
